msgid "`使用 inotify 监控文件系统的活动 <http://www.ibm.com/developerworks/cn/linux/l-ubuntu-inotify/>`_"
msgstr "`Monitoring filesystem activity with inotify <http://www.ibm.com/developerworks/cn/linux/l-ubuntu-inotify/>`_"

#: ../../c/inotify.rst:88
msgid "`Inotify: 高效、实时的Linux文件系统事件监控框架 <http://www.infoq.com/cn/articles/inotify-linux-file-system-event-monitoring>`_"
msgstr "`Inotify: an efficient, real-time Linux filesystem event monitoring framework <http://www.infoq.com/cn/articles/inotify-linux-file-system-event-monitoring>`_"

